{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into the warm and bustling world of a seaside Italian bakery in this cooperative online simulation game! Whether you\u2019re a master baker or just starting out, the oven is waiting for you.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044510/extras/bc9ead728515cee5ba789dc93664ddd0.avif?t=1758637703\" width=640 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from a variety of pizzas and breads and start cooking. Make your dough. Fire up your oven. And delight your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044510/extras/9991b51cf7c03c54e94e9cb07a33436d.avif?t=1758637703\" width=640 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Have fun alone or with up to four friends. Divide tasks appropriately with your friends. Manage your bakery.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044510/extras/8b5a026910cfd18c12332c3d002c61ab.avif?t=1758637703\" width=640 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perform thorough product inspections. If you can't deliver the product your customer wants on time, they'll be unhappy and leave. Buy the right products in the right quantity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you ready to roll the dough, fire up the ovens, and create the ultimate seaside Italian bakery experience? Gather your friends, start baking, and serve up some delicious chaos!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044510?t=1758637703","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044510?t=1758637703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044510/55a85aeba48eafa87136c78800bc7cd083def281/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758637703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044510/55a85aeba48eafa87136c78800bc7cd083def281/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758637703","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into the warm and bustling world of a seaside Italian bakery in this cooperative online simulation game! Whether you\u2019re a master baker or just starting out, the oven is waiting for you.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044510/extras/bc9ead728515cee5ba789dc93664ddd0.avif?t=1758637703\" width=640 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from a variety of pizzas and breads and start cooking. Make your dough. Fire up your oven. And delight your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044510/extras/9991b51cf7c03c54e94e9cb07a33436d.avif?t=1758637703\" width=640 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\